= Andrei Kolegaev

Kolegaev (1886-1937), a Left SR, is the party's expert on the land, and one of the authors of the land decree.

- @action
- @root: Return to main

@action
title: Land Decree
subtitle: Kolegaev carries out the redistribution of land.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0 and lsr_in_gov = 1
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before the next advisor action. ?][? if not (lsr_in_gov = 1) : We are not in the government. ?]
on-arrival: {!
Q.advisor_action_timer = 6;
Q.last_advisor_action = 1;
Q.month_actions += 1;
RO.add(Q, {land_pressure: -8}); RO.boost(Q, {peasants: 5}); RO.fac(Q, 'unions', 1, -1);
!}

Kolegaev's commissars went out to the provinces with copies of the decree, and a thousand estates were divided in a week.

